  "rationale": "84 units of Cheese Slices 500ML at Outlet 06 (East Bengaluru) are projected unsold before the expiry deadline on 2026-09-19; doing nothing writes off ₹6794 and a blanket 20% markdown costs ₹2719. This play uses a bundle with SKU-MULTIGRAIN-BREAD-400G at ₹160 for 233 consented customers (Tea connoisseurs, Dairy occasionals, Everyday staples shoppers, Festival sweets loyalists): expected 20 units, margin ₹280, discount cost ₹305, waste avoided ₹1643 (CI 1 to 59 units; prior n 20, measured n 0). Policy v1: \"2. Prefer bundles and transfers over blanket markdowns; markdowns are the last lever.\" This bundle play pairs the cheese slices with multigrain bread at a bundle price of 160 INR, which maintains a net margin of 8.62% (above the 8.00% dairy floor) and is preferred by policy over a blanket markdown. It targets high-affinity segments to clear the expiry risk at the outlet node.",
